menu "Wi-Fi provisioning"
config PROVISIONING_SECURE
    bool "USB provisioning commands and device TLS identity"
    default n
    help
        Enables the USB console provisioning commands (used by the browser
        flasher and tools/provision.py) and creates the TLS identity that the
        camera viewer serves over HTTPS. Wi-Fi is provisioned only over USB;
        the board never opens a setup access point.
endmenu
